{"title":"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the temperature in Whitehorse is −16℃ and the temperature in Kitchener is 3℃, how many degrees warmer is it in Kitchener than Whitehorse?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the temperatures, Kitchner is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b3bda607562278734ad83050925c344188572b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\circ}\\text{C} - (-16^{\\circ}\\text{C}) = 3^{\\circ}\\text{C} + 16^{\\circ}\\text{C} = \\boxed{19^{\\circ}\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"305\" height=\"26\" /> warmer.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC\">2025 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=